{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03037",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 5.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "sorry, uh, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.85,
      "end_seconds": 10.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.82,
      "end_seconds": 24.24,
      "duration_seconds": 12.42,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so doctor, it's shoulder tip pain. It's getting on my nerves now. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.99,
      "end_seconds": 34.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Alright, when was the first time you noticed it? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.08,
      "end_seconds": 44.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "About... well, six months. I've had sudden severe pain in the lower tummy too, for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.77,
      "end_seconds": 57.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Any fever, discharge or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.21,
      "end_seconds": 61.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "no, um, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.7,
      "end_seconds": 65.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.58,
      "end_seconds": 69.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.7,
      "end_seconds": 83.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.54,
      "end_seconds": 85.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "yes, eczema"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.49,
      "end_seconds": 95.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Right, so eczema is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.44,
      "end_seconds": 103.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.42,
      "end_seconds": 119.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.24,
      "end_seconds": 124.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Right, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.21,
      "end_seconds": 129.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.83,
      "end_seconds": 135.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "oh, I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.31,
      "end_seconds": 141.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.8,
      "end_seconds": 157.43,
      "duration_seconds": 14.63,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.55,
      "end_seconds": 160.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.69,
      "end_seconds": 175.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "So, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.94,
      "end_seconds": 197.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 112 beats a minute, blood pressure 99 over 66, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temp 36.9 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.61,
      "end_seconds": 202.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Right, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.48,
      "end_seconds": 207.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.2,
      "end_seconds": 212.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.23,
      "end_seconds": 217.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.23,
      "end_seconds": 220.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.3,
      "end_seconds": 242.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "you are pale and clammy with a rigid, tender tummy and a very low blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.16,
      "end_seconds": 259.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.88,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably a ruptured ectopic pregnancy. A ruptured ovarian cyst is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.7,
      "end_seconds": 262.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.84,
      "end_seconds": 276.7,
      "duration_seconds": 12.86,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a ruptured ectopic pregnancy is my leading thought, not anything worse. Urgent blood tests is what I'd like next, for internal bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.54,
      "end_seconds": 278.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.46,
      "end_seconds": 295.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.22,
      "text": "I am calling the emergency team, you need an operation now. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.22,
      "end_seconds": 298.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.69,
      "end_seconds": 301.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
  ]
}